        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Serious Sam 3: BFE is a first-person action shooter, a glorious throwback to the golden age of first-person shooters where men were men, cover was for amateurs and pulling the trigger made things go boom.\n\nServing as a prequel to the original game, Serious Sam: The First Encounter, Serious Sam 3 takes place during the Earth’s final struggle against Mental’s invading legions of beasts and mercenaries.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Serious Sam 3: BFE es un shooter de acción en primera persona, un glorioso homenaje a la época dorada de estos juegos, cuando los hombres eran hombres, las coberturas eran para aficionados y apretar el gatillo hacía que todo estallara.\n\nComo precuela del juego original, Serious Sam: The First Encounter, Serious Sam 3 transcurre durante la última lucha de la Tierra contra las legiones de bestias y mercenarios invasores de Mental.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
