        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The iconic Serious Sam brings his trademark relentless intensity to this bigger, bolder, more colorful sequel to the classic Serious Sam: First and Second Encounters! Tasked with rescuing the universe one bullet at a time against overwhelming hordes of time traveling enemies, Serious Sam must battle through thick jungles, murky swamps, frozen tundra, and futuristic cities to bring down Mental and his vile armies. Serious Sam 2 is a shot of adrenaline to the hearts of first-person shooter fans across the world. This is serious!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El icónico Serious Sam aporta su implacable intensidad característica a esta secuela más grande, audaz y colorida de los clásicos Serious Sam: First and Second Encounters. Encargado de salvar el universo una bala a la vez frente a abrumadoras oleadas de enemigos viajeros del tiempo, Serious Sam debe atravesar densas junglas, pantanos oscuros, tundras heladas y ciudades futuristas para derrotar a Mental y a sus viles ejércitos. Serious Sam 2 es una dosis de adrenalina para los aficionados a los shooters en primera persona de todo el mundo. ¡Esto es serio!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
